Everything else
---------------
    main.tex, the files under sections/, references.bib, latexmkrc and
    the placeholder images under figures/ are example content. They are
    meant to be overwritten, and are placed in the public domain under
    CC0 1.0 so that nothing in a paper you write from this template
    carries an obligation back to it.

    https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

The placeholder images in figures/ are generated by figures/placeholders.tex
and contain no third-party material.
